{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/f50f9059d48baee0e3b0e8f5468bbf48.poster.avif?t=1759079344\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/f50f9059d48baee0e3b0e8f5468bbf48.webm?t=1759079344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/f50f9059d48baee0e3b0e8f5468bbf48.mp4?t=1759079344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scour the abandoned corridors of Tasselwood High School. A routine check in the middle of the night turns in to a fatal game of cat-and-mouse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/900a8ccd3df8b2c53fd43f28c9aceec4.webp?t=1759079344\" width=11 height=11 /></span>Why was the school sealed off in such haste?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/900a8ccd3df8b2c53fd43f28c9aceec4.webp?t=1759079344\" width=11 height=11 /></span>What is <i>Project Luminaire</i>?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/900a8ccd3df8b2c53fd43f28c9aceec4.webp?t=1759079344\" width=11 height=11 /></span>Who killed Bethany Carlington?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/900a8ccd3df8b2c53fd43f28c9aceec4.webp?t=1759079344\" width=11 height=11 /></span>And who\u2019s waiting for you in the halls that should\u2019ve been empty?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/d8fead2cb31272105ed317df8fd2e3ff.avif?t=1759079344\" width=1560 height=86 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Puzzles</strong><br>Search classrooms, offices, and ruined corridors for clues. The building itself resists you - collapsing elements, locked doors, and fragments of a story hidden in forgotten corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Storytelling</strong><br>Multiple paths, multiple endings. Environmental storytelling leads you forward, but the truth won\u2019t be handed to you. Optional secrets reveal answers you weren\u2019t even asking for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunted in the Dark</strong><br>You\u2019re not alone. Keep your flashlight close - the shadows are watching, and they move when you don\u2019t.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/73ca2dcb98acb4426b133a1249fe9d48.avif?t=1759079344\" width=1560 height=86 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves - immersion is survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones recommended for full impact</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This psychological horror game deals with heavy themes which may be upsetting. Play at your own discretion.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216280?t=1759079344","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/991ff941b23b24b90679fe9d4b0247e8cdb7abee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759079344","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/ebb3247