t is <i>Project Luminaire</i>?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/900a8ccd3df8b2c53fd43f28c9aceec4.webp?t=1759079344\" width=11 height=11 /></span>Who killed Bethany Carlington?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/900a8ccd3df8b2c53fd43f28c9aceec4.webp?t=1759079344\" width=11 height=11 /></span>And who\u2019s waiting for you in the halls that should\u2019ve been empty?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/d8fead2cb31272105ed317df8fd2e3ff.avif?t=1759079344\" width=1560 height=86 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Puzzles</strong><br>Search classrooms, offices, and ruined corridors for clues. The building itself resists you - collapsing elements, locked doors, and fragments of a story hidden in forgotten corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Storytelling</strong><br>Multiple paths, multiple endings. Environmental storytelling leads you forward, but the truth won\u2019t be handed to you. Optional secrets reveal answers you weren\u2019t even asking for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunted in the Dark</strong><br>You\u2019re not alone. Keep your flashlight close - the shadows are watching, and they move when you don\u2019t.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/extras/73ca2dcb98acb4426b133a1249fe9d48.avif?t=1759079344\" width=1560 height=86 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves - immersion is survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones recommended for full impact</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This psychological horror game deals with heavy themes which may be upsetting. Play at your own discretion.</strong></p>","developers":["51kness"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216280/1bde300ccbcf82be651b644c427f3598f057c03a/header.jpg?t=1759079344","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3216280/1517086962/06a35871264d6f75cbf1e7c75a6fc45b7c437f4e/1758962178/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758962553","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3216280/1517086962/06a35871264d6f75cbf1e7c75a6fc45b7c437f4e/1758962178/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758962553","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3216280/1517086962/06a35871264d6f75cbf1e7c75a6fc45b7c437f4e/1758962178/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758962553","id":257207312,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207312/movie480.mp4?t=1758962553","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207312/movie_max.mp4?t=1758962553"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207312/85b3243367846ea71cf1c6c5e91e5aacfe4fea3f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758962553","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207312/movie480.webm?t=1758962553","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207312/movie_max.webm?t=1758962553"}}],"name":"Wretch","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minim